Package: skkzram
Version: 1.2
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Skykaiser <chengao246@gmail.com>
Depends: bash, util-linux, kmod
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Description: Lightweight zram swap management via systemd
 Automatically sets up zram swap at boot; configurable via /etc/skkzram.conf.
 .
 This package provides enhanced zram swap management with:
  - Configurable compression algorithm (lzo, lz4, zlib, lz4hc, zstd)
  - Adjustable swap size and priority
  - Multiple zram device support
  - Advanced logging with multiple levels
  - Writeback device support for idle pages
  - Memory percentage-based sizing
  - Idle page writeback timeout configuration
  - Detailed monitoring capabilities
Installed-Size: 120
